# Unanchored on purpose. A leading-slash `/target` matches the workspace root
# ONLY, which is how 969 files of cargo build state under
# crates/opencli2go/target (102 MB) came to be committed — a cost paid by
# every clone here and by every xyd job that checks out this submodule.
target/
node_modules/
.DS_Store

# NOTE: Cargo.lock and package-lock.json are COMMITTED on purpose. Nearly every
# gate in this repo is a BYTE comparison against a committed golden tree, so an
# unpinned patch bump in a transitive dep can flip a golden on a PR that changed
# nothing. Do not add them here.
